@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 90
title XMPP reconnect: domain ack и artifact digest
participant "Sender outbox" as o
participant "XMPP relay" as x
participant "Receiver inbox" as i
participant "Executor" as e
participant "Artifact store" as store
o -> x : signed domain envelope (message_id)
x --> o : XEP-0198 ack
note over o : Keep pending domain delivery.
x -> i : envelope
 i -> i : bytes + dedup durable commit
 i --> o : signed received_durable
 i -> e : validate + admit operation
e --> o : admitted / refused
... disconnect / reconnect ...
o -> x : SM resume or retransmit same bytes
x -> i : possible duplicate
 i --> o : stored application ack/status
 o -> e : reconcile operation_id / ledger cursor
e --> o : receipt + artifact digest/size
o -> store : bounded fetch (optional XEP-0363 URL)
store --> o : bytes
 o -> o : verify digest/size; publish local CAS
note over o,store
URL and HTTP 201 are not authorization or integrity proof.
No new execution on reconnect.
end note
@enduml
